  "body": "PR #3456 requires servers to be able to hand out the prev_events and their state for newly sent events. However, if the prev event is from a point where the receiving server isn't in the room, the receiving server may not have permission to see the event.\r\n\r\nWe should handle this more gracefully than (temporarily) throwing the event away.",
